        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Noah, The Virgins\n- People: Nazril Irham, Mohammad Kautsar Hikmat, Loekman Hakim, David Kurnia Albert, Donald Cumming, Wade Oates, Nick Zarin-Ackerman, Erik Ratensperger\n- Albums: Seperti Seharusnya, Strike Gently\n- Places: Indonesia, New York City\n\nFacts:\n- Noah originally consisted of Nazril Irham, Mohammad Kautsar Hikmat, Loekman Hakim, and David Kurnia Albert.\n- The Virgins consisted of lead vocalist Donald Cumming, guitarist Wade Oates, bassist Nick Zarin-Ackerman, and drummer Erik Ratensperger.\n- Seperti Seharusnya is a studio album by the Indonesian band Noah.\n- Strike Gently is the second and final studio album by the New York City band The Virgins.",
